<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- CINDERWORKS — Foundry 9: a 5v5 round-based tactical FPS in three.js.
  Two teams, short rounds, money between rounds, a charge to plant and
  defuse. Attackers (EMBERS, amber) plant the charge at Furnace (site A)
  or Casting (site B); defenders (WARDENS, blue) hold the sites and defuse.
  Single-player against nine bots with routes, sight, hearing and reaction
  time. Click to play: WASD move, mouse look, click fire, R reload, 1/2
  weapons, 4 smoke, E plant/defuse, B buy menu, Ctrl crouch, Space jump. -->
